Serve this repo as plain static files — no Jekyll build.

Without this file GitHub Pages runs Jekyll, which silently drops every path
beginning with an underscore. That 404s the OpenProse case study's
openprose/_tokens.css and openprose/_pairings.css (and the canvas-display
copies), so the page loses IBM Plex, Kecal and its entire palette and falls
back to Times. The site has no Jekyll content of any kind, so turning the
build off costs nothing.
